#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-throw.rst:5 971cfe287d2845c1a88d141f045bd830
msgid "SkyRocket Throw Mode"
msgstr "SkyRocket投掷模式"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-throw.rst:10 f80a81598d6e480287f03baa84b21a8f
msgid ""
"The SkyViper is such a small frame that is is great for :ref:`Throw Mode "
"<throw-mode>`. If you want to try throw mode then first read the :ref:`throw"
" mode documentation <throw-mode>`."
msgstr ""
"SkyViper机架非常小，非常适合 :ref:`Throw Mode <throw-mode>`。如果您想尝试投掷模式，请先阅读 "
":ref:`投掷模式文档 <throw-mode>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-throw.rst:13 6488fc566a274e6baede88f6ee216bdf
msgid "Here are some extra tips for throw mode on the SkyViper:"
msgstr "以下是SkyViper使用投掷模式的额外技巧："

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-throw.rst:15 75fefb4ec5b04b30adda5abe9ce94274
msgid ""
"you can assign throw mode to a button on your TX. Go to the web interface at"
" ``http://192.168.99.1`` and choose the parameters page. Then assign throw "
"mode to one of the action buttons. I like using ACTION5, which you get by "
"holding the MODE button, then pressing the right shoulder button (the one "
"marked with the photo icon)"
msgstr ""
"您可以将投掷模式分配给遥控器上的某个按钮。进入Web界面 ``http://192.168.99.1`` "
"并选择参数页面。然后将投掷模式分配给某个动作按钮。推荐使用ACTION5，通过按住MODE按钮，再按右肩部按钮（标有相机图标的按钮）触发"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-throw.rst:20 07a37291a06a4d6b9435c61c11c5dccd
msgid "wait till you have full GPS lock (green LED on transmitter is solid)"
msgstr "等待GPS完全锁定（遥控器绿色LED常亮）"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-throw.rst:21 0001213fc61846c9be17952e8d2bca7e
msgid ""
"with your skyviper disarmed and on the ground, select throw mode with the "
"button you have setup in the first step. You will hear a bip-boop-bip sound "
"from the TX"
msgstr "skyviper上锁并在地面上，使用第一步设置的按钮选择投掷模式。遥控器将发出bip-boop-bip声音"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-throw.rst:24 ddcd9d5f06f54ccfaab31b116f452225
msgid ""
"now press the \"return\" button to arm your copter. The motors will not "
"start spinning."
msgstr "现在按\"return\"按钮解锁飞行器。电机不会开始旋转。"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-throw.rst:26 631bd3b6a31d4b73ba010724fecb1ad5
msgid ""
"look at your transmitter LEDs. If the green LED is flashing rapidly then you"
" are ready to throw. Do not throw the copter unless the green LED is "
"flashing rapidly"
msgstr "观察遥控器LED。如果绿色LED快速闪烁，则准备好投掷了。绿色LED快速闪烁时才能投掷飞行器"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-throw.rst:29 1029362ab7cc44d6bef6b6b8db22922b
msgid ""
"pickup the copter by one of the legs, keeping fingers clear of the "
"propellers"
msgstr "抓住飞行器的一条腿，手指远离螺旋桨"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-throw.rst:31 ef6c4e239a6d446284ecd8d466ae97d3
msgid "throw it as high as you can with one smooth motion"
msgstr "用一个流畅的动作尽可能高地投掷"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-throw.rst:32 7deef7c46a7b499c91037f0bfab17915
msgid ""
"do NOT swing your arm back and forward to \"wind up\" for the throw, "
"otherwise the copter may think the throw has been done and will start the "
"motors"
msgstr "切勿手臂前后摆动\"蓄力\"，否则飞行器可能认为投掷已完成并启动电机"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-throw.rst:35 5a991433421f47978efb36dd586e1af0
msgid ""
"be ready to press the power button on the TX for instant disarm if something"
" goes wrong"
msgstr "做好准备，一旦出现问题立即按遥控器电源按钮进行即时上锁"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-throw.rst:37 4bd285e5c32d44c6bce8770c36cd9641
msgid ""
"after the throw, the copter will take a few seconds to settle, then will "
"automatically switch to LOITER mode for you to fly it"
msgstr "投掷后，飞行器将需要几秒钟稳定，然后自动切换到Loiter模式供您飞行"
